    {
      "id": "p0226-b015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Many other potential interpretations exist too, of course. In short, with its simplicity and emotional depth, this \"despite everything, it's still you\" line has spawned countless pieces of fan fiction, fan art, and even permanent tattoos.",
        "raw": "Many other potential interpretations exist too, of course. In short, with its\nsimplicity and emotional depth, this \"despite everything, it's still you\" line has\nspawned countless pieces of fan fiction, fan art, and even permanent tattoos.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
