    {
      "id": "p0226-b016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Naturally, Toby and the localization team put a lot of thought into this line to preserve its many potential nuances. In the end, the team decided to prioritize the content of the message over its sheer memorability. So although the resulting literal translation is less celebrated than its English counterpart, it does retain the intent of the original line, while still flowing naturally in Japanese.",
        "raw": "Naturally, Toby and the localization team put a lot of thought into this line to\npreserve its many potential nuances. In the end, the team decided to prioritize\nthe content of the message over its sheer memorability. So although the\nresulting literal translation is less celebrated than its English counterpart, it does\nretain the intent of the original line, while still flowing naturally in Japanese.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
